te fitting  but back to the spoiler conversation  between kurama and naruto  naruto asks how it is different from the  nine tails mode  and the six paths mode and kurima  mentions that it's fundamentally  different  and he restates the same thing in a  different way saying that before  they were using chakra from other places  and this time they are using each of  their chakras as raw materials to create  new energy and kurama emphasizes the  fact that they shouldn't make  unnecessary movements  because they want the new form to last  as long as possible and to be used to  its fullest  this naruto as i guessed and probably  most of us did  was nothing like the one before i was  mentioning that he'd ridiculously  surpass  sasuke's level if he could hold his own  against ishiki  when sasuke and old naruto couldn't even  do that working together  and sure enough when the fight begins  naruto is more than holding his own  we're told he overwhelms ishiki in the  beginning and dodges some shots  when ishiki tries to bury him under  blocks naruto manages to easily lift  them  while sasuke is simply trying to take  boruto away from the battlefield  ishiki responds that it's impossible  that naruto could manage such a sudden  surge of power  building up the hype even more so we  leave off with naruto's new form holding  its own at the very least  and we jump to kawaki and a motto  through the prosthetic arm that naruto  gave him kawaki realizes that naruto is  getting weaker  the new deadly form is clearly taking  its toll and we move back to naruto so  even though for a time  naruto was doing more than well now he's  physically exhausted he drops to one  knee  and the pattern on his new form is  disappearing burto gets worried but  feints from pain we're told  ishiki mentions that the enhanced  ability of naruto summoned is a great  killing ability but he will only win  if he sacrifices his life so i look  forward to the official translations  here because  from this it seems like ishiki is saying  naruto could definitely win  if he chose to sacrifice his life but  then ishiki laughs at naruto for losing  which is a bit weird  we know naruto is ready to sacrifice his  life to win  so why would ishiki be happy if naruto  would win by sacrificing his life  again this will probably make more sense  with the official translations  then just as ishiki is being cocky he  vomits blood and becomes shaky  ishiki is shocked wondering what  happened saying that naruto's attack  should not have been fatal  and naruto then seems to say who were  you saying is going to die  end quote implying that it's going to be  ishiki and then he says the real battle  starts now which is hella hype  and kurama says what i expected inside  naruto he mentions that the power is  definitely above ishiki  but they still can't beat him because  the side effects are so great that  they'll be the first to die compared to  ishiki  so this form seems to even surpass  reincarnated ishiki  but not enough to kill him before its  time runs out  and for ishiki he too is quickly running  out of time  he thought he had 20 hours left but now  it seems he only has 30 minutes left i  also predicted in my video about how  straw naruto's new form is  that naruto would push ishiki enough so  that he'd exhaust a lot of his remaining  energy  and that seems to be the only  explanation for ishiki's significantly  lower time limit  then kurama tells naruto to not think  about hitting ishiki  but to just think of hitting him with  every single and real  blow like boxing this is another  instance where i look forward to seeing  the official translation  but i'm guessing he means not to waste a  punch or kick that doesn't count  hold off until you know you'll cause  some real damage so as not to waste  unnecessary  energy and i do appreciate the boxing  analogy  shout out to hajime noipo while sasuke  can only watch and comment on naruto's  rapidly decreasing chakra borto is still  unconscious  ishiki actually manages to get naruto by  the neck  and then he feels kawaki's chakra and  laughs  ishiki says that he is the winner we  jump to kawaki who is taken through a  portal and everyone is left dumbfounded  and it seems that ishiki was able to use  the connection of naruto's arm on kawaki  to make a connection and bring him there  and so in the last minute  he can leave his karma on kawaki and so  this is a victory for him  then as if that wasn't crazy enough  apparently boruto's ipower drogon  activates  and that is the end of this chapter what  a freaking chapter for kishimoto to  return for  we got to see the new format work it was  surpassing ishiki for a time but ishiki  managed to last long enough to gain the  upper hand again  and even bring kawaki to him and boruto  awakened the drogon in the manga and  i've really been waiting for that  we got to see naruto shine and burtoshan  at the same time and this is arguably  gonna be the best chapter boruto yet  again we gotta take these translations  with a grain of salt but if the official  is  anything like this i feel like this  could be possibly the best chapter of  borto yet  anyways let me know what you thought of  these leaks and how you feel having the  original crater back in the driver's  seat  again i'm so glad myself because naruto  is my first manga and it will always  hold a special place in my heart so to  have the creator returning like this  is absolutely amazing if you did enjoy  this video and want to keep the naruto  slash boruto videos coming  make sure to smash that like button to  let me know and share this video with  any fellow naruto fans  if you haven't be sure to subscribe and  this is crucial hit that notification  bell and select all or you will miss  future naruto slash porto videos  so if you haven't make this the day you  subscribe and as you wait for the next  porto chapter or videos to drop  feel free to check out my growing naruto  porto playlist where i got videos